  "notes": "Cause code and category are TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields; narrative describes a direct cause (database not updated) and root cause (inadequate configuration control process UNT-007-029) which are captured in proximate_text/theme without overriding the official TBD code. Three previous similar LERs referenced as stubs per rule 9; LER numbers given without leading unit digit in the narrative, copied verbatim as stated. PS and FHB WRGM HRD/MRD modeled as distinct components/failure paths since they are physically distinct detectors affected via parallel maintenance events, per rule 5 (single trigger - failure to update DB - leading to two parallel failures)."
